      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, what do you mean by \"gremlins\"? i just need to know if i should send a technician out to check the fiber line or if i should just look at the config on the router. \n\nthe jitter is getting worse, it's jumping from 10ms to 200ms+ randomly. looks like it might be a bad SFP module or something. do the logs suggest a hardware fault?",
